{
  "dialogueLines":
  [
    {
      "id": "intro_1",
      "illustration": "Intro_P1",
      "portrait": "Elias_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "1...",
      "nameText": "Elias"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_2",
      "illustration": "Intro_P1",
      "portrait": "Elias_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "2...",
      "nameText": "Elias"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_3",
      "illustration": "Intro_P1",
      "portrait": "Elias_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "3...",
      "nameText": "Elias"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "illustration": "Intro_P2",
      "portrait": "Elias_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "Lola, why exactly do we have to do this every year?",
      "nameText": "Elias"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "illustration": "Intro_P3",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "Iho, we do this to show appreciation of our guardians and beloved Anitos.",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_6",
      "illustration": "Intro_P4",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "Ah, apo.. could you pass me that book on the table?",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_7",
      "illustration": "Intro_P5",
      "portrait": "Elias_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "This one, Lola? It...",
      "nameText": "Elias"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_8",
      "illustration": "Intro_P6",
      "portrait": "Elias_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "It can hardly pass as a book at this point po.",
      "nameText": "Elias"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_9",
      "illustration": "Intro_P7",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "That's called an Anito book, iho, gifted to us by the spirits",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_10",
      "illustration": "Intro_P7",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "My late grandmother used to say that this book was the boundary between our realm and the-",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_11",
      "illustration": "Intro_P8",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "!?",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_12",
      "illustration": "Intro_P8",
      "portrait": "Elias_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "Haha are the spirits usually this stingy with their gift?",
      "nameText": "Elias"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_13",
      "illustration": "Intro_P8",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "Elias, do not disrespect them like that! T-these torn pages.. it's not normal!",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_14",
      "illustration": "Intro_P8",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "Only Sitan's followers would be bold enough to commit this sacrilege!",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_15",
      "illustration": "Intro_P8",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "This means.. our world and the spirits' realm became one again the moment those pages were torn!",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_16",
      "illustration": "Intro_P9",
      "portrait": "Elias_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "Lola! What is happening?!",
      "nameText": "Elias"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_17",
      "illustration": "Intro_P9",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "<b>Lintik!</b> Sitan must have heard our conversation!",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_18",
      "illustration": "Intro_P10",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "Iho, take the Anito book and get in the house, quick!",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_19",
      "illustration": "Intro_P10",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "That darned Underworld Deity is a relentless stickler for rules and superstitions!",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_20",
      "illustration": "Intro_P10",
      "portrait": "Elias_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "Wha- but what about you?!",
      "nameText": "Elias"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_21",
      "illustration": "Intro_P10",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "This isn't something we can stop together.",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_22",
      "illustration": "Intro_P10",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "If I don't come back in a couple of days...",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_23",
      "illustration": "Intro_P10",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "An ally will be residing in the Balete trees, he will be able to guide you.",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_24",
      "illustration": "Intro_P10",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "Now, go!",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_25",
      "illustration": "Intro_P11",
      "portrait": "Lola_Dialogue_Icon",
      "bodyText": "<i>I leave the rest to you Elias, go... and become a Babaylan...</i>",
      "nameText": "Lola Isang"
    }
  ]
}